# Build 88. Kain's EIJIA on four Poleziaxes (formation 148, x layout 4:
# $A8 $F8 $148 $198). Its cast ends in loc_3462 ($F9): an effect over
# each shown enemy whose script is loc_34EE[(d3A & $7F) * 7 + column],
# the column from the enemy's x -- $198 is none of the six named, so
# column 6 and script $47 of loc_27364.
#
# loc_27364 has 72 entries; its $41 is `(loc_274C6+6)-loc_27364`, which
# extract_battle.py's regex skipped until this build. Every entry after it
# moved down one and $47 fell off the end: the effect over the fourth
# Poleziax had no script, never reached $FE, and held $CC06 at 1 -- the
# fight stood at "actions animating" for good (the harness's first
# fight_smart EIJIA on Red Dam F2 found it). Three enemies (layout 3)
# never use column 6, which is why EIJIA had worked before.
#
# Fails on 87b's battle.json at the `wait idle` after FIGHT.

start battle 148
members Rolf Kain
member Rolf 23
member Kain 15
wait idle
press down                   # STGY
press c
wait idle
press c                      # ORDR
wait idle
press right                  # Kain
wait ticks 3
press c
wait idle
press right                  # TECH
wait ticks 3
press c
wait idle
press down                   # stop 1 is FOI, NEXT above it
wait ticks 3
press down                   # EIJIA
wait ticks 3
press c
wait idle
expect screen battle
limit 3000
press c                      # FIGHT
wait ticks 60
shot 01_eijia
wait idle
expect command tech
expect screen battle
expect no-stderr no animation script
shot 02_next_round
